@startuml
title JeryMotro — Architecture globale technique

actor Utilisateur as U
cloud "Internet" as I
node "Nginx / HTTPS" as N
node "Frontend React/Vite" as FE
node "Backend FastAPI" as BE
database "Base SQL
Données JeryMotro" as DB
cloud "NASA FIRMS" as FIRMS
cloud "Service ML externe" as ML
node "n8n" as N8N
database "Qdrant
Base de connaissances" as Q
node "WAHA" as WAHA
node "SMSGate / HTTPSMS" as SMS

U --> I
I --> N : HTTPS/443
N --> FE
N --> BE : api.jerymotro...
→ localhost:8200

BE --> DB : SQL / SQLAlchemy
BE --> FIRMS : HTTPS / CSV API
BE --> ML : HTTPS / JSON
BE --> N8N : HTTPS webhook
BE --> WAHA : HTTP API
BE --> SMS : HTTP API

N --> Q : HTTPS
→ localhost:6333
N --> N8N : HTTPS
→ localhost:5678

N8N --> DB : données structurées des feux
N8N --> Q : recherche vectorielle
si nécessaire
N8N --> ML : génération / service
selon workflow

note right of BE
Pipeline principal :
FIRMS
→ validation
→ région
→ scoring
→ clustering
→ FireEvent
→ alertes
end note

note bottom of N
Nginx termine TLS et route
les sous-domaines vers
les services locaux.
end note

@enduml
